---
import PreviewLayout from '../layouts/PreviewLayout.astro';

const title = "Full Policy | Island Goodes";
const description = "Complete booking policies, cancellation terms, smoking rules, and house policies for Island Goodes adults-only accommodation in Hilo, Hawaii.";
---

<PreviewLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg">
      <img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="Island Goodes property" />
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/policies">Policies</a> / Full Policy
      </nav>
      <h1>Island Goode's Policies</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Complete terms and conditions for your stay</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="policy-content">

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>General Policies</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Minimum two-night stay.</strong> Room rates are figured with double occupancy (2 persons). No extra persons. Maximum room capacity is 2 persons.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Registered Guests Only</h2>
          <p>For the safety of our other guests, only registered guests are allowed to be in your room or are allowed to be on the property. We do not allow subletting of rooms for any reason or adding a person into your room that has not already been confirmed on your original reservation.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Maximum Room Capacity</h2>
          <p>Room capacity is for the safety of all our guests. Because of the strict fire codes and County regulations, we must enforce our policy on this. Please do not come with extra persons over the maximum room capacities.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Child Policy</h2>
          <p>Children are restricted (below 18 years). Please do not come with children or you will have to find other accommodations on your own and you will forfeit all monies with no refunds.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Pet Policy</h2>
          <p>No Pets allowed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Meals</h2>
          <p>We no longer serve meals. You are welcome to bring in your own food and enjoy either in your room or outside on your private lanai (patio). There is a microwave oven and toaster to reheat foods/beverages and other appliances as listed on our room description page.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Taxes</h2>
          <p>All rooms are subject to Hawaii's <strong>17.97% tax</strong>, which includes transient accommodation tax (TAT) 13.25% and general excise tax (GET) 4.72%.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Confirmation</h2>
          <p>Total payment must be paid in advance. A confirmation will then be emailed to you by Island Goode's. The email will have a confirmation number, arrival date, departure date, total cost of reservation.</p>
          <div class="important-notice">
            <p><strong>THE CONFIRMATION DOCUMENT IS VERY IMPORTANT.</strong> WITHOUT THIS DOCUMENT, IT WILL MAKE IT VERY DIFFICULT FOR YOU TO HAVE A SMOOTH EASY SELF CHECK-IN. PLEASE BRING THIS ARRIVAL CONFIRMATION DOCUMENT WITH YOU FOR AN EASY SELF CHECK-IN.</p>
            <p>THE CONFIRMATION MAY TAKE SEVERAL HOURS TO ARRIVE AT YOUR EMAIL BOX. PLEASE CALL US AT <a href="tel:+18089642291">808-964-2291</a> IF YOU ARE CONCERNED WITH YOUR RESERVATION/CONFIRMATION OR YOU HAVE NOT RECEIVED YOUR CONFIRMATION.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Check-In / Check-Out</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Check-In:</strong> Between 3 pm to 12 mid-nights. We are not able to accept early arrivals or hold your baggage.</li>
            <li><strong>Check-Out:</strong> 11 am</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block highlight">
          <h2>Smoking/Burn Rules</h2>
          <p>"No Smoking" is now a State Law in Hawaii. We take this very seriously. Also, NO burning of anything in the rooms or outside such as matches, candles, incense, mosquito coils, etc.</p>
          <p><strong>NO SMOKING/BURNING IN ANY ROOMS OR OUTSIDE OF ROOMS IS ALLOWED INCLUDING ELECTRONIC CIGS OR VAPES.</strong></p>
          <p>We have trade winds blowing most of the time on the Island, so smoke can travel in and around the facility and enter other rooms.</p>

          <div class="fee-list">
            <div class="fee-item">
              <span class="fee-amount">$250.00</span>
              <span class="fee-desc">per occurrence for smoking/burning in your room (special cleaning fee)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fee-item">
              <span class="fee-amount">$100.00</span>
              <span class="fee-desc">fee for smoking/burning outside your room and not in the designated smoking area</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>These fees will be debited from your credit card on file. If it occurs a second time in your group/party (inside or outside room), you will be fined again and will be asked to leave.</p>
          <p>Do not throw into any trash containers or flush down the toilet any smoking products, cigarette packages, butts, ashes.</p>
          <p><strong>If you need to smoke:</strong> Take a walk and go to the driveway entry or beyond. Two chairs are there for your comfort as well as a butt/ash can trash dispenser.</p>
          <p class="agreement-text">You agree and agree to pay, if you are asked to leave or decide to leave, you will forfeit all monies charged for your stay and any fines incurred for smoking as we (management) decide. By signing this agreement, you are agreeing and giving us authorization to apply charges to your credit card on file for smoking in your room or outside of the designated smoking area, damages and any losses.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Cancellation/Termination Policy</h2>
          <h3>Non-Refundable Reservations</h3>
          <p>All reservations are non-refundable. We no longer refund reservations if canceled for any reason. However, we do offer a <strong>1-year voucher to rebook your stay</strong>.</p>
          <p>If you are concerned about the possibility of cancelling your reservation, we recommend you purchase travel interrupt insurance through a third party for your own financial protection. We always use World Nomads.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="policy-block">
          <h2>Cancellations Special Conditions</h2>

          <div class="condition-item">
            <h3>Hurricane/Storm Policy</h3>
            <p>Hurricane season is from June to November. The Big Island has never had a hurricane hit the island in recent history. We suggest travel interrupt insurance through a third party for your own financial protection if you are worried about the possibility of a hurricane/tropical storm interfering with your travel plans to Hawaii/The Big Island. We recommend World Nomads insurance. Our Island Goode's Policies will apply.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="condition-item">
            <h3>Lava Flow Policy</h3>
            <p>We are in one of the safest lava zones (hazard 8) on the Big Island, hazard 9 being the safest. We are below Mauna Kea which is a dormant volcano and has not erupted in 4,700 years. We suggest travel interrupt Insurance through a third party for your own financial protection if you are worried about a volcanic event that might concern you. We recommend World Nomads insurance. Our Island Goode's Policies will apply.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="condition-item">
            <h3>Acts of Terrorism, Invasive Animals/Insects/Pandemic</h3>
            <p>These conditions are out of our control. We suggest travel interrupt Insurance through a third party for your own financial protection if you are worried about these problems and they concern you. We recommend World Nomads insurance. Our Island Goode's Policies will apply.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="back-link">
        <a href="/policies" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Back to Policies Summary</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Ready to Book Your Stay?</h2>
        <p>Check availability and reserve your room today</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="https://v2.reservationkey.com/3655/reserve/c" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book Now</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-large">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PreviewLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 45vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
  }

  .page-hero-bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .page-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.6) 100%);
  }

  .page-hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .policy-section {
    padding: var(--section-padding) 0;
  }

  .policy-content {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .policy-block {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  .policy-block.highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.05) 0%, rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.1) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.2);
  }

  .policy-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  }

  .policy-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-block p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .policy-block ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .policy-block li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .policy-block a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .important-notice {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(27, 107, 90, 0.1) 0%, rgba(27, 107, 90, 0.15) 100%);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .important-notice p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .important-notice p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .fee-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .fee-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .fee-amount {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #dc3545;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .fee-desc {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .agreement-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .condition-item {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .condition-item:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .condition-item h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .condition-item p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .back-link {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .btn-outline-dark {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .btn-outline-dark:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cta-section {
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid #fff;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .policy-block {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .fee-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
